cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software (the EPED-NN deep ensemble or the EPEDexplorer), please cite this repository."
title: "EPEDNN_Design.jl — EPED-NN deep ensemble with uncertainty quantification"
abstract: >-
  A fork of EPEDNN.jl adding a 12-input, height-only deep ensemble (with uncertainty
  quantification and out-of-distribution detection) for the tokamak H-mode pedestal,
  trained on the multi-machine EPED database plus new ITER-scale EPED scans. Powers the
  EPEDexplorer (https://iter.fuseexplorer.com/EPED).
type: software
